---
const yearsExperience = Math.abs(new Date().getFullYear() - 2011);
---

<section id="about-me" class="px-4 py-16">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
    <div class="mb-8">
      <p class="pixel-kicker">LEVEL 01</p>
      <h2 class="pixel-title mt-3 text-2xl sm:text-4xl">MEET THE COLORIST</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 font-crt text-2xl text-lavender">
        {yearsExperience} years licensed &middot; Master colorist
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="pixel-window md:col-span-2">
        <div class="pixel-window__bar">
          <span>ABOUT_ALMA.TXT</span>
          <span class="flex gap-1">
            <span class="pixel-window__btn"></span>
            <span class="pixel-window__btn"></span>
            <span class="pixel-window__btn"></span>
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="pixel-window__body">
          <p>
            Alma Palomares-Juarez is a licensed cosmetologist with over {
              yearsExperience
            } years of experience. Having gained her license out of Porter High
            School in Porter, Texas, she started her career by mastering men's
            hair cuts.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            While taking a brief break from the industry, Alma maintained her
            expertise doing freelance make-up, hair cut and color. Upon moving
            to Seattle, Washington, she began as a colorist apprentice at the
            prestigious{" "}
            <a
              href="https://www.genejuarez.com/locations/bellevue/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="underline decoration-2 underline-offset-2"
              >Gene Juarez Salon and Spa</a
            >, studying under several premier colorists before becoming a master
            colorist herself.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pixel-window">
        <div class="pixel-window__bar">
          <span>SKILL TREE</span>
          <span class="flex gap-1">
            <span class="pixel-window__btn"></span>
            <span class="pixel-window__btn"></span>
            <span class="pixel-window__btn"></span>
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="pixel-window__body">
          <p class="pixel-label mb-3">Mastery</p>
          <ul class="space-y-1">
            <li>▸ Balayage</li>
            <li>▸ Foliayage</li>
            <li>▸ Blonding</li>
            <li>▸ Custom Color</li>
            <li>▸ Color Correction</li>
            <li>▸ Cutting &amp; Styling</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
